# zahid.host



> Managed cloud hosting for e-commerce worldwide: CS-Cart, Magento, OpenCart, PrestaShop, WooCommerce. Multi-region CDN, GeoDNS, anti-DDoS, daily backups, 24/7 support in English, Ukrainian, Russian, Polish, and Spanish.



zahid.host runs production e-commerce stores on managed LXC containers across multiple datacenters. The platform bundles application-tuned hosting (CMS-specific OS templates, OPcache, Redis), a global CDN with bot protection, authoritative GeoDNS, and ZFS-snapshot backups. All operations run through a single billing API; orchestration is signal-driven and fully auditable. Customer base spans Europe, North America, Latin America, and Asia. Content is published in en/uk/ru/pl/es (see the sitemap for all locales); this index lists the English canonical pages.

